302
00:18:13,140 --> 00:18:15,290
You will meet many people
smarter than you in the future,

303
00:18:15,290 --> 00:18:17,660
and you will experience
a lot of setbacks and failures.

304
00:18:17,660 --> 00:18:18,850
If you can't even handle this,

305
00:18:18,850 --> 00:18:19,900
what will you do later?

306
00:18:19,900 --> 00:18:21,290
If I had a mindset like yours,

307
00:18:21,290 --> 00:18:22,980
I would have broken down long ago.

308
00:18:22,980 --> 00:18:24,500
This is a lesson you must go through.

309
00:18:24,500 --> 00:18:25,900
Come on, get up.

310
00:18:26,700 --> 00:18:28,380
Leave me alone!

311
00:18:28,940 --> 00:18:31,220
I-I was just trying to reason with you.

312
00:18:32,810 --> 00:18:34,610
You don't understand anything.

313
00:18:35,420 --> 00:18:38,220
I... I didn't say anything harsh.

314
00:18:40,050 --> 00:18:41,450
I'm going to school then.

315
00:18:42,290 --> 00:18:43,380
I left the milk here.

316
00:18:43,380 --> 00:18:45,380
Remember to drink it when you get up.

317
00:19:00,140 --> 00:19:01,810
Okay, let's go to the second one.

318
00:19:01,220 --> 00:19:03,990
[Constantly Strive to Become Stronger;
Strive to Be Number One]

319
00:19:02,420 --> 00:19:04,500
People don't need to worry because...

320
00:19:04,500 --> 00:19:06,700
A, B, C, D, E.

321
00:19:07,610 --> 00:19:09,140
Who knows the right answer?

322
00:19:50,290 --> 00:19:51,220
Hello.

323
00:19:51,570 --> 00:19:51,970
Hello.

324
00:19:52,770 --> 00:19:54,460
Lin Zhixia, it's me.

325
00:19:55,700 --> 00:19:56,610
Shen Fuxuan?

326
00:19:58,250 --> 00:19:59,500
What's up?

327
00:20:00,700 --> 00:20:02,630
Why didn't you come to class today?

328
00:20:03,090 --> 00:20:03,900
Are you sick?

329
00:20:07,290 --> 00:20:08,690
I have a bit of a headache,

330
00:20:08,940 --> 00:20:09,670
but I'm fine.

331
00:20:10,850 --> 00:20:12,940
My dad bought
some headache medicine before.

332
00:20:12,940 --> 00:20:14,140
It works really well.

333
00:20:14,790 --> 00:20:16,520
Do you want me to bring you some?

334
00:20:17,090 --> 00:20:18,830
No need. I'm almost recovered.

335
00:20:20,740 --> 00:20:23,240
I'll let you know if I need it.

336
00:20:23,830 --> 00:20:24,160
Okay.

337
00:20:24,850 --> 00:20:25,910
Get some rest then.

338
00:20:27,610 --> 00:20:28,140
Bye-bye.

339
00:20:28,570 --> 00:20:29,100
Bye-bye.

340
00:21:00,640 --> 00:21:08,270
♪ Wandering light wind
drifts past your pupils ♪

341
00:21:09,420 --> 00:21:13,650
♪ One second of encounter,
heartstrings stirred ♪

342
00:21:14,270 --> 00:21:17,630
♪ The story feels altogether different ♪

343
00:21:19,180 --> 00:21:23,520
♪ The moment our eyes met,
my world came alive with color ♪

344
00:21:24,190 --> 00:21:28,470
♪ Could this be how love begins? ♪

345
00:21:29,000 --> 00:21:32,060
♪ These unspoken feelings
are so hard to figure out ♪

346
00:21:32,590 --> 00:21:37,900
♪ Hidden deep within your gaze ♪

347
00:21:38,130 --> 00:21:42,540
♪ Sometimes, I imagine
drifting beyond the skies with you ♪

348
00:21:39,460 --> 00:21:40,460
Did you fold this?

349
00:21:43,280 --> 00:21:47,300
♪ Shimmering light
dances over the flower in bloom ♪

350
00:21:48,180 --> 00:21:51,030
♪ After all we've been through,
our fates remain intertwined ♪

351
00:21:50,140 --> 00:21:51,740
If Mr. Kong finds out you skipped class,

352
00:21:51,740 --> 00:21:52,850
he will be furious.

353
00:21:53,460 --> 00:21:54,520
You should go back.

354
00:21:55,160 --> 00:21:55,620
No need.

355
00:21:56,140 --> 00:21:57,140
I asked for leave.

356
00:22:02,200 --> 00:22:04,060
You didn't come to school all day.

357
00:22:05,050 --> 00:22:06,610
I was quite worried.

358
00:22:09,010 --> 00:22:09,980
I'm fine.

359
00:22:11,010 --> 00:22:12,330
I'll adjust on my own.

360
00:22:19,940 --> 00:22:21,870
If you're unhappy about anything,

361
00:22:22,850 --> 00:22:24,050
