362
00:22:28,570 --> 00:22:30,630
I thought since we became opponents,

363
00:22:31,940 --> 00:22:33,940
we wouldn't chat like this anymore.

364
00:22:34,740 --> 00:22:36,470
Actually, these past few days,

365
00:22:37,330 --> 00:22:38,930
I've been quite conflicted.

366
00:22:40,740 --> 00:22:41,800
Speaking of which,

367
00:22:42,330 --> 00:22:43,850
