370
00:22:47,420 --> 00:22:48,810
I should be very happy.

371
00:22:49,500 --> 00:22:52,500
After all, I achieved my goal
through my own hard work.

372
00:22:53,420 --> 00:22:54,700
But after that, when facing you,

373
00:22:54,700 --> 00:22:57,030
I became much more sensitive than before.

374
00:22:58,500 --> 00:22:59,330
After the competition that day,

375
00:22:59,330 --> 00:23:01,390
I noticed you were acting strangely.

376
00:23:01,940 --> 00:23:03,940
But I didn't know how to comfort you.

377
00:23:04,290 --> 00:23:06,620
I was afraid you'd think
I was showing off.

378
00:23:11,570 --> 00:23:13,380
These past few days,
I've been trying to figure out

379
00:23:13,380 --> 00:23:14,940
what is bothering me.

380
00:23:17,610 --> 00:23:20,410
Is it that a former good friend
became an opponent?

381
00:23:21,090 --> 00:23:23,250
Or was it because my poor decision

382
00:23:23,700 --> 00:23:25,630
led to the loss of the competition?

383
00:23:27,220 --> 00:23:28,480
It seems to be neither.

384
00:23:31,350 --> 00:23:32,210
Then what is it?

385
00:23:37,280 --> 00:23:39,700
It's that I've been trying
so hard to fit in,

386
00:23:42,080 --> 00:23:44,140
yet it's always so difficult to do so.

387
00:23:50,500 --> 00:23:53,940
