398
00:24:20,810 --> 00:24:24,500
A competition actually
consists of many factors.

399
00:24:25,420 --> 00:24:27,680
Tang Tingting had her own takeaways too.

400
00:24:28,140 --> 00:24:30,500
So you don't need
to care too much about it.

401
00:24:34,330 --> 00:24:34,810
Yeah.

402
00:24:36,140 --> 00:24:37,470
Everyone had takeaways

403
00:24:38,570 --> 00:24:40,250
