447
00:27:55,010 --> 00:27:55,940
We were supposed

448
00:27:56,380 --> 00:27:58,500
to open the box in junior high,

449
00:27:59,140 --> 00:28:00,500
but you left suddenly.

450
00:28:02,010 --> 00:28:03,420
Let's dig it out now.

451
00:28:16,530 --> 00:28:18,740
Why are we digging it up today?

452
00:28:20,090 --> 00:28:21,290
Don't you understand

453
00:28:21,770 --> 00:28:24,290
