455
00:28:29,530 --> 00:28:31,380
The answer is on that note.

456
00:28:40,980 --> 00:28:41,770
Found it.

457
00:29:21,610 --> 00:29:25,850
Be best friends
with Jiang Yubai forever.

458
00:29:28,940 --> 00:29:31,340
Become a genius
as excellent as Lin Zhixia.

459
00:29:39,500 --> 00:29:42,160
Actually, this has always been
my true thought,

460
00:29:42,980 --> 00:29:45,780
