502
00:31:53,330 --> 00:31:55,330
I thought it was a good start

503
00:31:56,290 --> 00:31:58,660
and that I would slowly make good friends

504
00:31:59,940 --> 00:32:01,610
and slowly fit into the group.

505
00:32:07,610 --> 00:32:09,540
I didn't expect to mess it up again.

506
00:32:12,570 --> 00:32:13,900
You must believe

507
00:32:14,460 --> 00:32:15,860
that this is a good start.

508
00:32:17,130 --> 00:32:20,060
And never be afraid of
having conflicts with others.

509
00:32:20,460 --> 00:32:21,570
Whatever happens,

510
00:32:21,810 --> 00:32:22,740
good or bad,

511
00:32:23,420 --> 00:32:24,530
is an indispensable puzzle piece

512
00:32:24,530 --> 00:32:25,810
in your life story.

513
00:32:26,660 --> 00:32:27,460
I believe

514
00:32:28,140 --> 00:32:29,940
the high school life you long for

515
00:32:30,940 --> 00:32:32,470
will definitely come true.

516
00:32:46,810 --> 00:32:49,540
Don't you want to
be good friends with me forever?

517
00:32:50,220 --> 00:32:51,550
Aren't we good friends?

518
00:32:51,850 --> 00:32:54,180
I mean being good friends with me forever.

519
00:32:55,420 --> 00:32:56,050
I do.

